OL,3,GNEWSA'Pimping website' inquiry finds
OL,4,Ahuman trafficking 'hidden in plain
OL,5,Asight' online
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn investigation into "pimping
OL,8,Fwebsites" has found that human
OL,9,Ftrafficking is a "catastrophic" problem
OL,10,Fthat is being "hidden in plain sight
OL,11,Fonline".
OL,13,FThe Stormont inquiry was prompted by
OL,14,Fgrowing concerns about the exploitation
OL,15,Fof trafficked and vulnerable women on
OL,16,Fonline platforms.
OL,18,FThe subsequent report found women who
OL,19,Fwere forced into prostitution as
OL,20,Fteenagers, advertised online, drugged
OL,21,Fbefore "appointments" and moved through
OL,22,Fcities one day at a time.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
